{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/8dcb4cee1471f704510f7023ba887308.avif?t=1766044765\" width=1536 height=324 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f<strong>Discount Nightmares</strong>\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Is an <i>episodic series</i>. Each episode is a self contained, unique, thrilling, horror, mystery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\ud83c\udf35<strong>The Gulch</strong>\ud83c\udf35</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Working in the gulch is a tough job. It's even tougher when you might get eaten in the middle of the night!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>About This Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gulch</i> is a horror adventure with tones of comedy, built in the spirit of classic \u201990s style puzzle games. Think of it as the successor to the Point and Click Game. You wake in a remote desert settlement with no memory of who you are. The boss insists your work here is vital\u2014though he won\u2019t explain why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, you\u2019ll complete your duties: mining, operating strange machinery, and navigating a maze of rusting shipping containers and abandoned caves. By night, the sirens warn you to stay inside\u2026 because something lurks out in the dark!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a unique <strong>five senses system</strong>, you\u2019ll explore the Gulch in ways most games never attempt. Look, touch, listen, smell, and even taste your way through a landscape of puzzles, secrets, and growing dread. The further you dig into the routine, the more you\u2019ll realize nothing at the Gulch is what it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/1472c868bc6b469d0c247bff1404c068.poster.avif?t=1766044765\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/1472c868bc6b469d0c247bff1404c068.webm?t=1766044765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/1472c868bc6b469d0c247bff1404c068.mp4?t=1766044765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Senses Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Interact with the world by seeing, touching, smelling, tasting, and listening. Each sense can reveal different clues, puzzles, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Adventure Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Collect items, combine them, and use them in unexpected ways across a richly interactive environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Horror</strong> \u2013 A slow escalation from uneasy humor to full-on terror, where daily tasks become tinged with paranoia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Routine vs. Terror</strong> \u2013 Balance working the mines, maintaining machinery, and following \u201cthe rules\u201d with surviving the horrors that lurk after dark.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration &amp; Discovery</strong> \u2013 Traverse mines, cabins, shipping yards, and burned ruins while uncovering secrets hidden in every corner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Encounters</strong> \u2013 Form fragile bonds with the workers as you question their motives\u2014and your own identity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Miss Fortune</strong>\u00a0\u2013 Save your game at anytime at the fortune telling machine. It might cost you though.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consumables\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Coins, med kits and more! Why not do a little shopping along the way. The gulch offers ample places to spend some coins, which you can find all over the large environment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>The Gulch</i>, the question isn\u2019t just whether you\u2019ll survive the night\u2026 but whether you really want to find the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/9e3620fbdc31c8bb091df60da631cb14.poster.avif?t=1766044765\" width=1170 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/9e3620fbdc31c8bb091df60da631cb14.webm?t=1766044765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/extras/9e3620fbdc31c8bb091df60da631cb14.mp4?t=1766044765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Discount Nightmares series aims to move the Point &amp; Click genre into the next generation. With all the same classic tropes of\u00a0 Point &amp; Click but now in a 3D, first person perspective. The classics vibes and pixilated art style still remain. Collect items to solve Rube Goldberg style puzzles. Talk to interesting characters. Solve the mystery!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986650?t=1766044765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/6b1fa6796a67f3669b67ab7361a891b4adc992cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766044765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/f819100b2d84772f2e204279c97a09c7525aa5a1