same classic tropes of\u00a0 Point &amp; Click but now in a 3D, first person perspective. The classics vibes and pixilated art style still remain. Collect items to solve Rube Goldberg style puzzles. Talk to interesting characters. Solve the mystery!</p>","developers":["SongMonkey"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986650/b085261c27bac744080ab86fb03b0cab4cbb8fe8/header.jpg?t=1766044765","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/825219454/5a369d623f946947d0fe3e715a4653a7119e9fc2/1756938241/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758303428","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/825219454/5a369d623f946947d0fe3e715a4653a7119e9fc2/1756938241/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758303428","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/825219454/5a369d623f946947d0fe3e715a4653a7119e9fc2/1756938241/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758303428","id":257192456,"name":"The Gulch - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192456/b72b1f1b0107ae4260b50e54e8bf4ba4d78834e3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758303428"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/769741602/c04ca9adf462e4a9d6241e2f12a5c1bb36bb7d49/1756853723/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758303431","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/769741602/c04ca9adf462e4a9d6241e2f12a5c1bb36bb7d49/1756853723/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758303431","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3986650/769741602/c04ca9adf462e4a9d6241e2f12a5c1bb36bb7d49/1756853723/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758303431","id":257191491,"name":"The Gulch - Horror Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257191491/21b8d2130334ae5c055cb77b053